Prefix: : <https://finsight-tech.com/ontology/examples/real-product-models/bond#>

Ontology: <https://finsight-tech.com/ontology/examples/real-product-models/fixed-rate-bond>


# ************************************************************************
# Fixed-Rate Bond - Product Modelling Experiment
# ************************************************************************
#
# Combines issuance semantics with the economic terms of a fixed-rate bond.
# The example is intentionally focused and does not attempt to provide a
# complete ontology for bonds.
#


### Parties and issuance

Class: Party

Class: LegalEntity
    SubClassOf: Party

Class: SecuritiesIssuance

Class: Security

Class: Bond
    SubClassOf: Security

ObjectProperty: issuerOf
    Domain: Party
    Range: SecuritiesIssuance

ObjectProperty: issues
    Domain: SecuritiesIssuance
    Range: Security


### Bond economic terms

Class: PrincipalTerms

Class: InterestTerms

Class: FixedRateInterestTerms
    SubClassOf: InterestTerms

Class: MaturityTerms

Class: PaymentSchedule

Class: CalculationBasis

Class: FixedRate


### Economic relationships

ObjectProperty: hasPrincipalTerms
    Domain: Bond
    Range: PrincipalTerms

ObjectProperty: hasInterestTerms
    Domain: Bond
    Range: InterestTerms

ObjectProperty: hasMaturityTerms
    Domain: Bond
    Range: MaturityTerms

ObjectProperty: hasFixedRate
    Domain: FixedRateInterestTerms
    Range: FixedRate

ObjectProperty: usesCalculationBasis
    Domain: FixedRateInterestTerms
    Range: CalculationBasis

ObjectProperty: hasPaymentSchedule
    Domain: FixedRateInterestTerms
    Range: PaymentSchedule


### Product type described through its economic structure

Class: FixedRateBond
    EquivalentTo:
        Bond and hasInterestTerms some FixedRateInterestTerms

Class: FixedRateInterestTerms
    SubClassOf:
        hasFixedRate some FixedRate,
        usesCalculationBasis some CalculationBasis,
        hasPaymentSchedule some PaymentSchedule
